# Trivy ignore list — currently empty, deliberately.
#
# Policy: do not add a CVE here to make CI green. If it is reachable from
# package.json, fix it with a dependency bump or an `overrides` entry.
# Anything listed here needs a reason and a re-check trigger.
#
# History worth keeping: this file briefly carried exemptions for CVEs in
# ip-address and brace-expansion. Both lived inside npm's own vendored
# dependency tree at /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/node_modules/, which no
# package.json change can reach — the only lever was installing a newer npm,
# and none existed with the fixes. The exemptions were removed when npm was
# deleted from the runner image instead (see the Dockerfile runner stage).
#
# That is the preferred shape of a fix: make the vulnerable code structurally
# absent rather than suppressed. Suppression only held until the scanner's
# vulnerability database updated and flagged a different CVE in the same
# package, which is exactly what happened here.

# --- Active exemptions ---

# CVE-2026-14456 — openssl DoS via unbounded memory growth in the QUIC server.
# Present as libssl3/libcrypto3 3.5.7-r0 in the node:26-alpine base image.
#
# Reason: no fixed package exists to install. Trivy reports a fixed version of
# 3.5.8-r0 from Alpine's secdb, but that build has not been published: on
# 2026-08-29 both Alpine 3.24 (the base image's branch) and alpine:edge still
# offered 3.5.7-r0 as the only candidate. `ignore-unfixed: true` does not filter
# it because secdb announces the fix ahead of the package. No dependency bump,
# `apk upgrade` or base image change can reach it, and nothing here imports
# openssl from package.json. The site is served behind a reverse proxy and does
# not expose an openssl QUIC server.
#
# Re-check trigger: the expiry below. Once it passes, Trivy stops honouring this
# line and the build fails again. By then Alpine should carry 3.5.8-r0, in which
# case delete this entry — do not extend it without re-verifying that the
# package is still genuinely unavailable.
CVE-2026-14456 exp:2026-09-30
